OL,3,GNEWSA'No evidence' police mergers will
OL,4,Awork, says PCC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Fsaid there was "no evidence" a proposal
OL,8,Fto replace 43 forces with between eight
OL,9,Fand 10 ones would help tackle crime.
OL,11,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood said
OL,12,Fearlier this year she wanted to
OL,13,Fdrastically reduce the number of police
OL,14,Fforces to make them more efficient.
OL,16,FThe Met's Sir Mark Rowley has now
OL,17,Fproposed an eight-to-10 force model and
OL,18,Fsaid the current system was "heading
OL,19,Ffor failure" if changes did not happen.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
