OL,3,GNEWSA'No evidence' police mergers will
OL,4,Awork, says PCC
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Hertfordshire's Conservative
OL,7,FPCC Jonathan Ash-Edwards said: "Large
OL,8,Fregional forces have been beset by low
OL,9,Fcrime detection rates and cuts to local
OL,10,Fpolicing. We should not make the same
OL,11,Fmistakes in our counties."
